                    that time, see <ref target="frus1945v08#pg_25">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1945, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">viii</hi>, pp. 25</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
